  "source_sha256": "efe17bf6d7c68c122acd7b4257230329bada0261602c743ee84a248774fb06f9",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b98b3add282c5a63891e725597d7f2b1988704484505e9a691581787e43a8737",
      "text": "Jade Rabbit’s\nFirst Ballet Class",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "14529fece69d17eb4183812d8fb475d636102aacab2cb85382f13c8bb7e3ba01",
      "text": "Jade steps into class.\n“I want to dance!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8fd1c787292b356ae4e31914542e204dcadf06fbbf127fed5e6030e5aaf0c44a",
      "text": "Soft shoes.\nA green skirt.\n“My ears are ready, too!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a67f79e8b40a11cb45f361e661140435b5a332346f92079a8d131180413bd8f8",
      "text": "The teacher plays a tune.\n“Step with me.”\nStep, step, step.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fbc40349ee7c747ca2775de946b23ad7cd90899d6bb71dbd0bd673b96f025a0a",
      "text": "Jade hops up high.\n“Oops! That was a hop.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "fe82ce69d5369a945ff08d25bd595446dd3e053a4d0321acd0547e1be0c1b2d1",
      "text": "“Try small steps,” says the\nteacher.\nJade steps with Chang’e.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f014917adcd9fa8d39b767eef542291a0951e9402a582df078e56f8ed865e31e",
      "text": "Slow feet.\nSoft feet.\nThey move to the beat.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ff26eb721c797d8b410d3d3a394c4a35cf5340e56a7a36feb24bca837589f172",
      "text": "The music stops.\nJade stops.\nHer ears keep dancing!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "76fdb6eb4669330cff155a1c6f30e1b5b630fa7b3bf65f6cae9593110ac29e63",
      "text": "“Turn slowly,” says the\nteacher.\nJade makes a small turn.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "33a3794f61d0dfb1feada2d3b541f16a526b58983ff118df3b0ff446978c2bde",
      "text": "Chang’e turns the other way.\n“Oh! Hello, Jade!”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "345b4bbae80bb5de2b245544e29ab4c5a85fb170f26f5c6b42c0db6959def735",
      "text": "They giggle.\nThey try again.\n“Small steps. A slow turn.”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3552e043222029ec5f9b389831bc1aa37961b811e84fdbcd9ca767b2a9667920",
      "text": "Now Jade listens to the beat.\nStep, step.\nTurn, turn.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6c9b574d2f14ebbcc9bfaf909d6800c8286599c76bfbd5cc815f1ce8ca9736ec",
      "text": "“And stop!”\nTwo friends stop.\nTwo ears wobble.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1768b68e6f789740840301280619def4f5f01fb8119bc753d70572427c6a2445",
      "text": "“Let’s dance it all!”\nSmall steps. A slow turn.\nAnd stop!",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "eca6ddadae18118da8ec0a81c4918814df5912c46f05b56849234af737c5095a",
      "text": "“We did it!” says Jade.\nChang’e smiles and claps.",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "14e176c269aef0286c815434b12be23e5bdfd853773b85ef9674bea80ba7b82f",
      "text": "Jade takes a little bow.\nHer ears bow, too.\n“One more dance?”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b6f14abd05c0cd0e1ecc06a7a775d666ab6e243347598fcce36a91498c2c38c0",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed this story, you are welcome\nto support more. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStory and art made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
